WEBVTT

00:02.390 --> 00:05.360
<i>At the ends of the earth, 
blanketed by miasma,</i>

00:05.990 --> 00:10.590
<i>lay a forbidden kingdom to which 
no human was allowed entry.</i>

00:11.800 --> 00:17.730
<i>It was home to monstrous vassals who 
once dominated and devoured mankind.</i>

00:18.410 --> 00:22.400
<i>And over them reigned a king.</i>

01:53.000 --> 01:58.010
The Sacrifice and the Night of the Ritual

02:17.800 --> 02:18.810
Get out.

02:31.160 --> 02:32.080
Move.

02:58.270 --> 02:59.360
Get in.

03:08.430 --> 03:11.750
I have brought her, Your Majesty.

03:11.750 --> 03:14.080
This girl is the latest offering.

03:14.790 --> 03:18.140
The 99th sacrifice.

03:23.360 --> 03:25.680
Raise your head.

03:32.740 --> 03:34.560
Dear me.

03:35.030 --> 03:41.390
Of all the sacrifices the humans have sent, 
this girl is easily the scrawniest.

03:41.770 --> 03:46.770
Devouring the likes of her 
will not nourish you, sire.

03:46.770 --> 03:51.970
Perhaps you should simply tear her 
apart as a display for the nobility,

03:51.970 --> 03:55.220
and demand the next sacrifice 
be delivered at onc—

03:55.220 --> 03:56.110
Excuse me.

03:56.830 --> 03:59.990
Don't you think you're 
being a bit rude, Mr. Dog?

03:59.990 --> 04:01.460
D-Dog?

04:01.460 --> 04:04.560
Surely you do not mean me, 
the great Anubis?!

04:04.560 --> 04:06.930
There's at least enough of me to eat.

04:07.510 --> 04:09.270
Don't be wasteful.

04:09.270 --> 04:11.420
H-How dare you?!

04:11.420 --> 04:12.790
Bleh!

04:12.790 --> 04:15.340
Still your tongue in His Majesty's presence!

04:15.340 --> 04:16.500
But you said—

04:16.500 --> 04:17.820
Be silent!

04:17.820 --> 04:20.030
M-My most humble apologies, sire.

04:20.030 --> 04:21.730
This human knows not her place.

04:21.730 --> 04:25.120
No matter. Leave us, Anubis.

04:25.120 --> 04:27.040
B-But, sire, she—

04:32.320 --> 04:34.700
You dare talk back to your king?

04:35.000 --> 04:37.680
When I tell you to leave, you obey.

04:37.680 --> 04:40.930
P-Please forgive me. By your leave.

04:44.400 --> 04:46.340
What a short-tempered king.

04:47.140 --> 04:51.420
You mustn't snap at people like that, 
or someday you'll be all alone.

04:52.560 --> 04:55.590
His Majesty is terrifying! 
Say you're sorry right away!

04:55.590 --> 04:56.340
Away!

04:56.770 --> 04:58.320
And who might you be?

04:58.320 --> 04:59.270
Cy.

04:59.270 --> 05:00.480
And I'm Clops.

05:00.740 --> 05:02.840
We're supposed to keep an eye on you.

05:04.360 --> 05:06.990
Impudent human girl.

05:07.250 --> 05:09.860
Your show of boldness fools no one.

05:10.940 --> 05:17.000
Every sacrifice before you has trembled 
and wailed in terror in my presence.

05:17.310 --> 05:20.630
If you wish to make your 
death less agonizing,

05:20.900 --> 05:26.650
prostrate yourself before me, 
quake, and beg for your life.

05:26.650 --> 05:30.080
Aw, Your Majesty! 
Your paw pads are so squishy!

05:32.110 --> 05:34.420
You dare?

05:34.420 --> 05:40.010
Even if I escape, I have no home 
or family waiting for me.

05:40.010 --> 05:42.960
So you'll gobble me up, 
and that will be that.

05:43.780 --> 05:45.050
I don't mind.

05:48.510 --> 05:51.600
What is your name, human girl?

05:52.510 --> 05:56.580
I'm Sari. Sariphi. And you?

05:59.250 --> 06:01.750
I have no personal name.

06:01.750 --> 06:07.770
If I have a name, it is the blood in 
my veins which proves my royalty.

06:09.260 --> 06:14.930
The sacrificial ritual is on the next night 
of revelation, when the miasma clears.

06:16.030 --> 06:19.240
Let us see how long your bravado lasts.

06:19.660 --> 06:24.210
Until that time, I will make an 
exception and keep you at my side.

06:26.480 --> 06:29.920
Chancellor! Is Chancellor Anubis here?!

06:29.920 --> 06:31.820
What is the meaning of this?!

06:32.490 --> 06:36.780
The sacrificial girl is free 
and roaming the palace!

06:37.090 --> 06:39.760
Please calm yourselves, my lord speakers.

06:40.080 --> 06:43.420
She is in chains, and thus hardly "free."

06:43.420 --> 06:44.710
Spare us your quibbling!

06:45.160 --> 06:48.510
Does His Majesty mean to keep a human pet?!

06:48.510 --> 06:53.170
Really, these royal whims are intolerable. 
And the late king was just as bad.

06:53.900 --> 06:56.100
In the great war 100 years ago,

06:56.100 --> 07:01.220
His late Majesty arbitrarily 
made peace with the humans.

07:01.560 --> 07:08.680
Rebels who refuse to abide by his decree 
plague our land to this day.

07:08.680 --> 07:12.570
Indeed. And it is to quell such sentiments

07:12.570 --> 07:16.440
that the terms of the 
truce demand a sacrifice.

07:16.740 --> 07:21.210
It symbolizes that the 
humans are not our equals.

07:21.880 --> 07:24.330
I am well aware of that, of course.

07:24.330 --> 07:26.540
Just advise His Majesty.

07:26.890 --> 07:33.210
Tell him this is no time for games 
that might well leave him vulnerable.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.160
Your Majesty.

07:37.160 --> 07:39.860
Who gave you permission 
to leave my chambers?

07:40.330 --> 07:41.510
Cy, Clops.

07:42.360 --> 07:44.880
What have you been watching her for?

07:44.880 --> 07:47.440
W-We beg Your Majesty's pardon!

07:47.440 --> 07:48.740
Pardon!

07:48.740 --> 07:51.200
Wait, sire, it was my idea to—

07:51.200 --> 07:55.140
Know your place and return to my chambers.

07:55.140 --> 07:56.380
Sire!

07:57.450 --> 08:03.320
But I was bored. Your chambers 
are so bleak and empty.

08:03.320 --> 08:06.380
I am a king. I lack for nothing.

08:07.600 --> 08:11.640
But don't you think some flowers 
would brighten things up?

08:11.640 --> 08:15.000
I have no interest in admiring flowers.

08:15.000 --> 08:18.750
Besides, flowers do not grow 
in the miasma of this land,

08:18.750 --> 08:22.860
which lifts only when the moon 
shines on the night of revelation.

08:22.860 --> 08:24.420
You're no fun.

08:24.420 --> 08:25.660
Be that as it may,

08:25.660 --> 08:30.820
a human like you will be minced meat the 
moment you leave this room and my sight.

08:31.300 --> 08:35.040
If you wish to live to see the day 
of the ritual, do as I say.

08:35.040 --> 08:36.320
Oh, I see.

08:36.320 --> 08:39.440
You were worried about me, 
weren't you, sire?

08:46.030 --> 08:48.030
Curse your insolence.

08:48.030 --> 08:52.470
I needn't wait for the ritual, you know.

08:52.470 --> 08:56.550
I could tear out your fragile throat 
on a whim here and now.

08:56.550 --> 09:01.370
Do you <i>still</i> not fear me?

09:02.820 --> 09:06.730
No. I know something much scarier.

09:09.490 --> 09:14.730
Once, when I was reading an old book 
on an awful, stormy night,

09:15.000 --> 09:21.330
I learned that my name means 
"sacrifice" in an ancient tongue.

09:21.720 --> 09:23.200
Maria.

09:23.660 --> 09:26.200
Maria, wake up.

09:27.870 --> 09:29.870
What is it, Sari?

09:29.870 --> 09:31.910
Did you have a nightmare?

09:32.720 --> 09:35.890
Go to Mom and Dad.

09:37.120 --> 09:40.780
I knew it. The next sacrifice 
will be from our village.

09:40.780 --> 09:44.160
Don't worry. Our girl will be safe.

09:44.160 --> 09:45.180
But...

09:45.520 --> 09:47.640
This is why we have a substitute.

09:48.290 --> 09:51.530
We took her in and raised her 
to prepare for this.

09:51.530 --> 09:52.380
Remember?

09:56.140 --> 10:00.360
I had just discovered I'd 
been raised as a sacrifice,

10:00.980 --> 10:07.240
but the cold stares of the people who'd been 
my parents were what really terrified me.

10:09.680 --> 10:12.300
But your eyes are nothing like that, sire.

10:12.910 --> 10:15.130
So you don't scare me at all.

10:20.640 --> 10:25.430
Do you force yourself to act angry?

10:26.700 --> 10:29.650
Sariphi, you are...

10:30.830 --> 10:32.900
a girl to be pitied.

10:38.290 --> 10:43.280
This is Daghtau, an old fortress city, 
and the closest one to Yoana.

10:43.890 --> 10:47.900
So it saw the fiercest fighting 
of the last great war.

10:47.900 --> 10:48.990
What is Yoana?

10:49.250 --> 10:52.520
It's what we call the human country.

10:53.180 --> 10:56.660
Even now, 100 years after the war, 
the scars still run deep.

10:56.960 --> 11:00.330
So the king often comes 
for inspections like this.

11:00.330 --> 11:01.140
This.

11:01.140 --> 11:02.470
Wow.

11:02.470 --> 11:05.310
Oh, what's that over there?

11:05.310 --> 11:08.680
Ah! That girl is loose again!

11:08.680 --> 11:10.300
Let her do as she pleases.

11:10.300 --> 11:11.190
But, sire...

11:20.130 --> 11:21.490
Ruins?

11:21.490 --> 11:23.430
Go no farther.

11:23.430 --> 11:24.570
Your Majesty?

11:24.570 --> 11:28.710
Cy, Clops, you've done enough. Leave us.

11:29.220 --> 11:30.260
Yes, sire!

11:31.400 --> 11:35.310
Unlike this place, the lower 
town is a lawless zone.

11:35.310 --> 11:40.680
As the farthest city from the palace, 
it is hotbed of rebellion.

11:40.680 --> 11:44.050
Even now, its people often 
cause strife with humans.

11:44.560 --> 11:46.270
Is that why you come to inspect it?

11:46.690 --> 11:52.330
Someone must stop fools 
from shedding needless blood.

11:52.330 --> 11:56.360
Through fear, the surest and 
most reliable method of all.

11:56.950 --> 12:01.330
A king should wield his power to that end.

12:02.220 --> 12:06.200
It must be hard to be a king.

12:08.000 --> 12:09.800
Where has His Majesty gone?

12:09.800 --> 12:13.000
Sir, he took the human girl 
to a hill overlooking the ruins.

12:13.550 --> 12:15.880
I believe they will return soon.

12:15.880 --> 12:16.460
Soon.

12:21.460 --> 12:24.090
Hm? Something smells nice.

12:30.140 --> 12:31.810
Flowers grow here?!

12:37.840 --> 12:40.570
The miasma is particularly thin here.

12:41.040 --> 12:44.270
It is the only place in this 
land where flowers bloom.

12:44.800 --> 12:49.490
Is that why you brought me here, sire?

12:49.490 --> 12:54.210
I can't have you wandering the palace 
the next time I take my eyes off you.

12:54.680 --> 12:56.300
Thank you!

12:56.300 --> 12:59.160
Oh, sire, can I pick some 
flowers to bring back?

12:59.160 --> 13:02.730
They would wilt at once in the palace.

13:03.220 --> 13:04.320
Please!

13:06.380 --> 13:07.850
Suit yourself.

13:13.310 --> 13:17.300
Hmph. Humans defy comprehension.

13:17.820 --> 13:20.970
Why care for something destined to die in—

13:21.350 --> 13:23.990
Here, sire. This is for you.

13:27.840 --> 13:29.690
You look adorable!

13:29.690 --> 13:32.810
You dare mock a king in his own kingdom?!

13:32.810 --> 13:34.080
But, sire...

13:34.300 --> 13:36.450
You're always making faces like <i>this</i>.

13:37.120 --> 13:40.960
Doesn't having pretty things 
like this to look at

13:41.480 --> 13:43.950
make you feel a little better?

13:52.290 --> 13:53.470
Sire?

13:54.410 --> 13:56.270
A storm approaches.

14:02.040 --> 14:04.900
After a string of such wild nights,

14:05.380 --> 14:08.370
comes the clear night of revelation.

14:08.840 --> 14:10.910
On that night, I will sacrifice you at las—

14:12.790 --> 14:14.710
Lightning!

14:15.750 --> 14:21.450
You don't fear beasts, yet a 
little thunder frightens you?

14:22.130 --> 14:23.410
I can't help it.

14:33.340 --> 14:37.150
I can't have you wailing 
over every lightning flash.

14:37.150 --> 14:40.940
This should do something to 
keep out the noise and light.

14:41.630 --> 14:42.460
Okay.

14:44.920 --> 14:47.270
Oh, you're so fluffy!

14:47.270 --> 14:51.990
How fickle. You were quaking 
in terror mere moments ago.

14:53.130 --> 14:56.200
You're so warm that I'm not scared anymore.

14:58.020 --> 14:59.530
You know, sire,

15:00.260 --> 15:05.550
you don't have to act tough in front of me.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.480
<i>Because it won't be long</i>

15:19.500 --> 15:21.790
<i>before my final night.</i>

15:25.550 --> 15:27.730
The miasma clouds have lifted.

15:28.190 --> 15:31.690
'Tis the night of revelation. 
The ritual is upon us at last.

15:31.990 --> 15:35.780
Listen closely. The ritual 
of sacrifice is a sacred thing.

15:35.780 --> 15:39.160
Watch your tongue and 
proceed carefully, lest—

15:39.160 --> 15:43.500
So sacrifices get to wear these 
lovely clothes, Chancellor?!

15:43.500 --> 15:47.690
Naturally! The sacrifice is to 
become part of His Majesty.

15:47.690 --> 15:48.870
No impurity may—

15:48.870 --> 15:50.620
It's like a wedding dress!

15:50.620 --> 15:52.620
Cy, Clops, how do I look?

15:52.620 --> 15:54.280
You look great, Sari!

15:54.280 --> 15:55.010
Sari!

15:55.010 --> 15:57.360
I told you to <i>listen</i>!

15:58.690 --> 16:00.850
By the way, where's the king?

16:00.850 --> 16:05.310
His Majesty does not show himself 
to us on the night of the sacrifice.

16:05.880 --> 16:09.340
Why not? Is it a royal tradition?

16:09.340 --> 16:12.150
None of our previous kings behaved thus.

16:12.490 --> 16:16.190
But it is not for us to question 
His Majesty's wisdom.

16:18.050 --> 16:22.200
Regardless, you are to wait quietly 
here in the altar chamber.

16:25.670 --> 16:29.610
<i>It's so dark. I can't even tell right from left.</i>

16:30.900 --> 16:31.620
Your Majesty?

16:35.820 --> 16:37.330
<i>It's not the king?!</i>

16:37.330 --> 16:40.390
B-Be silent, sacrifice girl.

16:41.020 --> 16:44.710
Tonight is a golden opportunity to 
get the king away from his retainers.

16:44.710 --> 16:48.730
I'll take your place and 
lie in wait for him here.

16:49.430 --> 16:51.240
What are you going to do to the king?!

16:51.240 --> 16:52.610
You have to ask?

16:52.610 --> 16:57.620
A-An indecisive king who panders 
to humans can't defend us.

16:57.620 --> 17:01.480
Here, on this very night, 
I'll topple him from his throne!

17:01.790 --> 17:04.870
Y-You're about to die anyway.

17:04.870 --> 17:07.500
I'll put your life to good use!

17:14.460 --> 17:16.180
A-An agent of the king?!

17:16.400 --> 17:20.880
O-Only a traitor would follow that coward!

17:21.970 --> 17:23.790
He's not a coward.

17:24.520 --> 17:28.480
The king tries to stop all the 
needless bloodshed he can.

17:28.480 --> 17:31.930
He denies himself to keep his people safe.

17:32.240 --> 17:35.610
His Majesty is a great king!

17:37.360 --> 17:41.920
E-Enough claptrap! You can die together!

18:00.690 --> 18:01.710
Wait!

18:02.780 --> 18:04.940
You're the king, aren't you?

18:12.850 --> 18:13.600
You're hurt.

18:13.600 --> 18:14.510
Do not touch me!

18:17.710 --> 18:19.750
I am no king.

18:19.750 --> 18:21.110
Yes, you are.

18:23.280 --> 18:24.930
I can tell.

18:27.190 --> 18:30.800
I am... no king.

18:31.910 --> 18:36.240
Though I was born a beast, 
half my blood is human.

18:36.690 --> 18:38.880
I can never truly be either.

18:40.140 --> 18:46.000
When the moonlit night of revelation 
exposes this other form,

18:46.000 --> 18:51.130
I merely hide in darkness and wait 
for it to pass. I'm a coward.

18:53.820 --> 18:59.370
For all my empty bluster, 
I can't fool even a single girl.

19:00.800 --> 19:05.410
How could such a pitiful weakling be a king?

19:09.200 --> 19:10.880
You're not weak.

19:12.040 --> 19:13.960
The chancellor told me.

19:14.280 --> 19:18.120
You always perform the ritual alone.

19:18.500 --> 19:23.390
No one's seen you eat any of the sacrifices.

19:25.340 --> 19:30.880
When dawn breaks, the sacrifice is gone, 
and there's human blood everywhere.

19:32.550 --> 19:36.220
That's how everyone knows 
you did the ritual.

19:37.650 --> 19:38.950
A weak person...

19:39.980 --> 19:43.810
A weak person couldn't 
do something like that.

19:45.390 --> 19:48.670
You're the strongest there is, sire.

19:49.750 --> 19:54.040
I'm so glad I got to be your sacrifice.

19:54.870 --> 19:56.450
Sariphi...

19:57.330 --> 20:00.790
Even if you let me go, 
I have no home to go back to.

20:01.450 --> 20:04.780
I can't go back to those cold stares.

20:05.860 --> 20:07.410
So I want my life to end

20:08.190 --> 20:10.380
with you eating me.

20:12.160 --> 20:16.950
I want to nourish someone strong and kind.

20:31.380 --> 20:34.480
<i>I'm so glad the last eyes to look at me...</i>

20:34.480 --> 20:35.560
Sari...

20:36.250 --> 20:38.590
<i>...were full of warmth.</i>

20:39.370 --> 20:40.620
Sariphi...

20:41.440 --> 20:44.120
<i>Thank you, sire.</i>

20:45.250 --> 20:48.760
Now you belong to me.

20:54.070 --> 20:55.850
S-Sire...

20:56.350 --> 20:58.340
I... I'm not sure I—

20:58.820 --> 21:00.320
Don't make me repeat myself.

21:00.930 --> 21:04.780
Henceforth, I will be taking 
Sariphi as my queen.

21:05.080 --> 21:10.270
N-Nonsense! You would dilute 
the royal line with human blood?!

21:10.270 --> 21:12.260
This is unprecedented!

21:12.530 --> 21:16.200
All who object, step forward if you dare!

21:18.610 --> 21:21.010
See? I told you they'd be upset.

21:21.010 --> 21:24.780
Oh, they won't complain. I won't let them.

21:25.300 --> 21:26.680
Sari!

21:26.680 --> 21:27.840
Ri!

21:29.080 --> 21:30.390
Oh, I almost forgot!

21:30.390 --> 21:34.800
I've been trying to come up with a name, 
sire. Would you like to hear it?

21:34.800 --> 21:35.950
A name?

21:35.950 --> 21:38.050
Yes, a name for you.

21:39.550 --> 21:40.930
Leonhart.

21:41.580 --> 21:46.060
It means "brave-hearted" in the 
ancient language of my country.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.520
Leonhart...

21:50.170 --> 21:52.930
Yes, I could live with that.

23:25.800 --> 23:27.810
Curse you, human wench!

23:27.810 --> 23:30.810
First you escape sacrifice, 
and now you inveigle my king!

23:30.810 --> 23:34.020
I shall soon expose your vile true nature!

23:34.020 --> 23:37.930
Despite what he says, I'm sure I can 
make friends with the chancellor, too.

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Next Episode

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Hornets and a Court Banquet

23:37.930 --> 23:38.980
Not a chance.

23:38.980 --> 23:39.840
Chance.
